6. Maintaining external documentation and API documentation for documentation purposes;
7. Employing error tracking and performance metrics for monitoring and logging;
8. Having a disaster recovery plan in place for backup and recovery;
9. Ensuring adherence to accessibility guidelines for compliance;
10. Limit response to 10 recommendations and provide examples where applicable.

